{
  "id": "c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate",
  "level": "C1",
  "version": 1,
  "topic": "Who should act on climate?",
  "parts": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "title": "Interview",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p1-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Good morning. First of all, we'd like to know a little about you.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate/p1-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q1",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, how aware are you of your own impact on the environment?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate/p1-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q2",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, what changes have you made to your lifestyle for environmental reasons?",
          "durationSec": 25,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate/p1-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6200
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q3",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think enough is being done about climate change?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate/p1-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4900
        },
        {
          "id": "p1-q4",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "text": "Candidate B, what are the biggest environmental problems in your area?",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate/p1-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5300
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "title": "Long turn",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p2-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "In this part of the test, I'm going to give each of you three pictures. I'd like you to talk about two of them on your own for about a minute, and also to answer a question briefly about your partner's pictures.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate/p2-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e27-a1",
            "c1-e27-a2",
            "c1-e27-a3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate A, your pictures show different parties involved in environmental issues. Choose two of the pictures and say what responsibility these groups have, and how successful their actions might be.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate/p2-a.mp3",
          "audioMs": 13800
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-a-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate B, who do you think has the most power to make a difference?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate/p2-a-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 4700
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "assets": [
            "c1-e27-b1",
            "c1-e27-b2",
            "c1-e27-b3"
          ],
          "text": "Candidate B, your pictures show people responding to environmental problems. Choose two of the pictures and say what the people hope to achieve, and what might limit their impact.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate/p2-b.mp3",
          "audioMs": 12200
        },
        {
          "id": "p2-b-follow",
          "kind": "turn",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 30,
          "text": "Candidate A, do you think protests are an effective way to bring about change?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate/p2-b-follow.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5500
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "title": "Collaborative task",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p3-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like you to talk about something together for about two minutes. Here are some actions that could reduce carbon emissions, and a question for you to discuss.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate/p3-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 10400
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-discuss",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 120,
          "diagram": "c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate",
          "text": "Talk to each other about this question: How effective might these actions be in reducing emissions?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate/p3-discuss.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7300
        },
        {
          "id": "p3-decide",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 60,
          "diagram": "c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate",
          "text": "Now you have about a minute to decide together. Which would have the greatest effect?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate/p3-decide.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "title": "Discussion",
      "steps": [
        {
          "id": "p4-intro",
          "kind": "narration",
          "text": "Now I'd like to ask you some more questions about climate responsibility.",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate/p4-intro.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q1",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Who bears the greater responsibility for solving climate problems, individuals or large companies?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate/p4-q1.mp3",
          "audioMs": 7400
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q2",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, to what extent should richer countries pay for poorer ones to protect the environment?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate/p4-q2.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q3",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, do you think people will accept a lower standard of living for the sake of the planet?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate/p4-q3.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q4",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "both",
          "durationSec": 50,
          "text": "Is there a danger that we rely too much on technology to solve environmental problems?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate/p4-q4.mp3",
          "audioMs": 6700
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q5",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "A",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate A, should governments ban products that are harmful to the environment?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate/p4-q5.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5600
        },
        {
          "id": "p4-q6",
          "kind": "open",
          "target": "B",
          "durationSec": 45,
          "text": "Candidate B, how can young people make their voices heard on climate issues?",
          "audio": "audio/C1/c1-e27-who-should-act-on-climate/p4-q6.mp3",
          "audioMs": 5700
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
